### Build

`npm run build` → ✓ Compiled successfully in 29.6s, all 10 pages generated, no TS errors.

### Key Design Decisions

- **pdfjs-dist stays**: needed by `react-pdf-highlighter` (client-side PDF viewer + highlight overlay)
- **pdf-parse removed**: was listed in package.json but never imported in source code
- **Coordinate system**: liteparse TextItem uses top-left origin (y=0 at top, increases downward) — consistent with react-pdf-highlighter expectations; comment added for future adjusters
- **Selective OCR**: try/catch wraps OCR pass so missing tesseract silently falls back to text-layer extraction
- **Screenshot batching**: all image-heavy pages collected then screenshotted in a single `parser.screenshot(buf, pageNums)` call for efficiency
